{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1127446-create-fetish-spirit-4","id":1127446,"title":"Create Fetish (spirit 4)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-10T19:30:10-07:00","id":1127446,"title":"Create Fetish (spirit 4)","content":"Hey everyone,<br /> <br /> I am playing Mage the Awakening version 1 (although any feedback with version 2 is welcome as well!).<br /> <br /> The question came when trying to use &quot;Create Fetish&quot; from Spirit 4 to capture an unwilling spirit into an object. The text says :<br /> <br /> The duration is <b>one scene</b><br /> To activate it you must roll gnosis+spirit so you can use it on the <b>next scene</b><br /> A dramatic failure causes it not to respond until <b>next scene</b><br /> It sleeps <b>the rest of the time</b><br /> <br /> And so on... It seems to be confusing, <b>does it last 1 scene? Or does it last more? Is it permanent?</b><br /> <br /> <b>My</b> first thought is that it creates a quick fetish and the text just leaves it ready for whenever you want to expand its duration. However it seems odd anyway...<br /> <b>The player</b><b>'s</b> first thought is that it is permanent. After all <b>everything</b> in the text suggests permanency.<br /> <br /> The rules for making it permanent are next to impossible anyway. A -10 dice penalty when the spell is contested by <b>resistance</b> is hopeless, so it makes me doubt as well. Add to this that the rules for permanency involve disbelief and it seems hopeless anyway (a big effort for a dissipating fetish). On top of this it requires Spirit 5 to do it.<br /> <br /> I checked the rules in version 2 and they do not seem much clearer either (although a clarification in V1 would be much appreciated!)<br /> <br /> I find it funny as well that there are no guidelines for the creation of the fetish either... I have Werewolf and other books and can improvise, but the spell seems hopeless.<br /> <br /> **********************<br /> <br /> As a side note. If I wanted to let the player do it permanent even if as a lesser version. Any ideas? Is it crazy?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1842-rluengo","name":"rluengo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T20:17:03-07:00","id":1127460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rluengo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1127446-create-fetish-spirit-4#post1127446\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey everyone,<br /> <br /> I am playing Mage the Awakening version 1 (although any feedback with version 2 is welcome as well!).</div> </div> </div> </div>To check: you're referring to First Edition and Second Edition?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The rules for making it permanent are next to impossible anyway. A -10 dice penalty when the spell is contested by <b>resistance</b> is hopeless, so it makes me doubt as well. </div> </div> </div>First Edition's Create Fetish is an extended casting, which means it adds spell factors by adding to the number of successes you need to accumulate.<br /> <br /> Second Edition's Craft Fetish is a Duration-primary spell that therefore can have a base Advanced Duration of one month without any penalties from that factor at Spirit 4.<br /> <br /> Neither of these has to deal with a -10 penalty to make their effects last indefinitely without engaging in a weird contortion well out of the way of the normal use of those mechanics.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I find it funny as well that there are no guidelines for the creation of the fetish either... I have Werewolf and other books and can improvise, but the spell seems hopeless. </div> </div> </div>The guidelines are &quot;you can use the spirit's Numina.&quot; There are multiple example Numina on the books even if you don't care to design an effect yourself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 08-10-2017, 11:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T21:00:16-07:00","id":1127472,"title":"","content":"Hey Satchel,<br /> <br /> Thanks!<br /> <br /> We are playing 1st edition. I just wanted those playing 2nd edition to feel free to give their feedback as well <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> So if I understand it clearly (1st edition). The target number is the :<br /> <br /> * Spirit Rank (let's say rank 3)<br /> * Extra duration (let's say two days for +4 successes required)<br /> * Do we need extra potency?!?!? Would disbelief affect this spell?<br /> <br /> IF I wanted to make it indefinite, then it would require Spirit 5 with +5 successes, right?<br /> <br /> ****************<br /> <br /> On the other hand, if we wanted to design a &quot;Lesser&quot; Create Fetish of level Spirit 3 (which means it needs Spirit 4 to go indefinite). What restrictions do you think it should have?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1842-rluengo","name":"rluengo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T21:10:40-07:00","id":1127474,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rluengo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1127446-create-fetish-spirit-4?p=1127472#post1127472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">* Do we need extra potency?!?!? Would disbelief affect this spell?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ostensibly no, but dispellation is a whole other matter.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> IF I wanted to make it indefinite, then it would require Spirit 5 with +5 successes, right? </div> </div> </div>Yup.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> On the other hand, if we wanted to design a &quot;Lesser&quot; Create Fetish of level Spirit 3 (which means it needs Spirit 4 to go indefinite). What restrictions do you think it should have? </div> </div> </div>That's pretty much just Rouse Spirit with a particularly long Duration.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}